@startuml auth-google

title Auth - Google OAuth 登入流程

actor User
participant "API\n(Endpoint)" as API
participant "Handler /\nService" as Handler
participant "PostgreSQL" as DB
participant "Google\nOAuth" as Google

note over User, Google
  前端先走 Google OAuth PKCE flow：
  → 取得 code + codeVerifier
end note

User -> API : POST /auth/google\n{ code, codeVerifier }
API -> Handler : GoogleAuthService.AuthAsync

Handler -> Google : POST /token\n{ code, clientId, clientSecret, redirectUri,\n  grantType=authorization_code, codeVerifier }
Google --> Handler : { idToken, accessToken }

Handler -> Google : GoogleJsonWebSignature.ValidateAsync(idToken)\n驗證 audience=clientId, issuer=accounts.google.com
Google --> Handler : { sub, email, name, picture }

Handler -> DB : FindByProviderAsync(Google, sub)
alt 找不到
  Handler -> DB : FindByEmailAsync(email)
  alt Email 也找不到
    Handler -> Handler : User.Create(name, email)
    Handler -> DB : AddAsync(user)
  end
  Handler -> Handler : user.AddAuthProvider(Google, sub)
end
Handler -> Handler : user.UpdateAvatar(picture, sub)
Handler -> DB : Update(user)

Handler -> Handler : GenerateAccessToken(...)\nRefreshToken.Create(...)
Handler -> DB : AddAsync(refreshToken) + SaveChanges
Handler --> API : 200\n{ accessToken, refreshToken, userId, name, expiresAt, sub, email, picture }

note over DB
  User.AuthProviders 支援多 provider 綁定：
  同一個 email 可同時有 Local + Google + LINE
end note

@enduml
